# Principles (MAUI)

Native .NET MAUI client for the Principles habit/goal app (install: https://principles.top). Package id `com.set.principles`. **Production store builds are Flutter** (`flutter-frontend-of-principles`); this MAUI app is the previous Android/iOS client kept for reference and API/behavior parity. Backend is .NET WebAPI (separate repo).

## Git

- Host is **GitHub only** (`origin`). Do not fetch, push, or set defaults on Bitbucket or other remotes.
- **Never commit** (or amend, stash-and-drop, or push) unless the user explicitly asks in the current request. Leave finished work uncommitted and say it is ready to commit.

## Core loop

1. Define a **goal**
2. Attach **habits** that automate progress (optionally via AI recommendations)
3. Complete habits; inspect detail (progress, streaks, stability)
4. Use **Tasks** for one-off work and to keep today's habits visible
5. Use **AI Helper** for support — not the primary recommendation entry point
6. Settings / profile (slogan, mission) feed AI habit recommendations

## Shell UX

- Tab order: Helper · Progress · **Tasks** · Profile
- Settings, Edit Habit, Habit Detail, auth screens are pushed routes (not tabs)
- Pre-login: App Benefits carousel
- Post-login: SyncGate bootstrap, then main tabs
- Daily habits report reminder and local notifications for tasks/habits
- AdMob interstitial ads (Android / iOS); Android in-app updates
- Goals may include optional **Notes**; do not wipe synced notes when the editor only changes the name
